'''''Gemmabryum dichotomum''''' is a species of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Bryaceae]].<ref name="worldfloraonline.org">{{cite web |title=Bryum urbanskyi Broth. |url=http://www.worldfloraonline.org/taxon/wfo-0001177386 |website=www.worldfloraonline.org |access-date=4 February 2021}}</ref>

It is distributed throughout [[Temperate climate|temperate]] regions of both hemispheres, as well as in [[Antarctic]] [[tundra]].<ref>{{Cite book |last=Spence |first=John R. |title=Flora of North America |isbn=9780190202750 |volume=28 |page=134}}</ref>

